1
00:00:00,240 --> 00:00:01,340
(Sheldon:)All right, fine.

2
00:00:01,340 --> 00:00:02,870
(Sheldon:)If we're not going
to give it a name,

3
00:00:02,870 --> 00:00:05,040
(Sheldon:)can we at least give it
a secret code designation?

4
00:00:05,040 --> 00:00:07,040
(Howard:)- No.
- Hear me out.

5
00:00:07,050 --> 00:00:09,410
(Sheldon:)The atomic bomb
was The Manhattan Project.

6
00:00:09,410 --> 00:00:12,270
(Sheldon:)Windows 95 was originally
Project Chicago.

7
00:00:12,270 --> 00:00:16,750
(Sheldon:)For our app, I would humbly
suggest Project Nodlehs.

8
00:00:16,760 --> 00:00:20,190
(Leonard:)That's just
"Sheldon" backwards.

9
00:00:20,190 --> 00:00:22,190
(Sheldon:)Another happy accident.

10
00:00:22,190 --> 00:00:25,930
(Leonard:)We're not wasting time
with names right now.

11
00:00:25,930 --> 00:00:27,560
(Sheldon:)I see.

12
00:00:27,570 --> 00:00:29,230
(Sheldon:)Is that decision open
for discussion?

13
00:00:29,230 --> 00:00:30,750
(Howard:)No.

14
00:00:30,750 --> 00:00:33,600
(Sheldon:)Is the decision to not
discuss it open for discussion?

15
00:00:33,610 --> 00:00:34,770
(Howard:)No.

16
00:00:34,770 --> 00:00:36,260
(Howard:)Again,

17
00:00:36,260 --> 00:00:38,180
(Howard:)right now it's just
a dummy procedure,

18
00:00:38,180 --> 00:00:40,610
(Howard:)but eventually,
it will drop us into...

19
00:00:40,610 --> 00:00:42,300
(Sheldon:)I call for a vote
of no confidence

20
00:00:42,300 --> 00:00:43,680
(Sheldon:)and an immediate change
in leadership.

21
00:00:43,680 --> 00:00:45,080
(Leonard:)Sheldon, stop it.

22
00:00:45,080 --> 00:00:47,180
(Sheldon:)When in the course of human
events, it becomes necessary

23
00:00:47,190 --> 00:00:48,440
(Sheldon:)to dissolve the bonds

24
00:00:48,440 --> 00:00:50,190
(Sheldon:)that tie three competent
scientists together...

25
00:00:50,190 --> 00:00:52,090
(Leonard:)That's enough, Sheldon.
All right, let's get right to the vote.

26
00:00:52,090 --> 00:00:53,970
(Sheldon:)Show of hands--
all those opposed

27
00:00:53,980 --> 00:00:55,790
(Sheldon:)to Leonard
and his reign of tyranny.

28
00:00:58,230 --> 00:00:59,730
(Leonard:)Okay, that's it, you're fired.

